       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ABSOLUTE-TOTAL-CLOSURE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOTAL-SYSTEM-STATE.
           05  WS-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE-SEALED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-STABILITY-SEALED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WITNESS-DECIDABLE-SEALED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-ZERO-GROUNDED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SEALED-CLOSURE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-UNIVERSAL-SEAL-VALID     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FINAL-SYSTEM-CLOSURE-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-SEAL-ALGEBRAIC-SYSTEM.
           PERFORM 2000-GROUND-TOTIENT-ZERO.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTAL-CLOSURE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-SEAL-ALGEBRAIC-SYSTEM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE-SEALED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-STABILITY-SEALED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WITNESS-DECIDABLE-SEALED.
       2000-GROUND-TOTIENT-ZERO.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-ZERO-GROUNDED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIVERSAL-SEAL-VALID.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTAL-CLOSURE.
           IF WS-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE-SEALED = 1 AND
              WS-DYNAMIC-STABILITY-SEALED = 1 AND
              WS-WITNESS-DECIDABLE-SEALED = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-ZERO-GROUNDED = 1 AND
              WS-UNIVERSAL-SEAL-VALID = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FINAL-SYSTEM-CLOSURE-MET
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-FINAL-SYSTEM-CLOSURE-MET.
